      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CROCODILE CRAWL (1) jumped cleanly from the rails last start to lead all the way and score (21.98) at Cannington in a Grade 6 over 381m. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. The hardest to beat again. LOVE FREQUENCY (5) was below best at her last start when 6th at Mandurah following a win (17.37) there two back. Should be about the money. ALISON'S MISSION (4) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 1.5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.54 beating Miss Star Lee. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from six starts. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. AUSSIE TAN (2) drops in distance and can play a major role.",
